      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 173 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Independence of Korea/The Korean Civil War)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "After Shillafell, many other countries tried to gain power over Korea."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "For a while, Korea was ruled by Japan."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Many Koreans did not like being under the power of Japan,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "so they fought against Japanese rule."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "In 1948, Korea was librated from Japan."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "A civil war broke out in 1950 when armies from the North"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "invaded the South."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "As a result, the Korean peninsula became divided into"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "North and South Korea."
    },
